window.products.push({"id":1062016,"name":"Rite Lite Jerusalem Hand-Painted Resin Chanukah Menorah, 12\" Hanukkah Candle Menorah","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Z7TlZmKIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Jerusalem Hand-Painted Resin Menorah: How special would it be to light the Menorah at the Western Wall? Pay tribute to this ideal with the striking and detailed Jerusalem Menorah. Constructed of hand painted resin, this Menorah features vivid artwork that will be enjoyed by all! CARE & CONTENTS: To clean wax from menorah: Pour hot water directly on the wax to loosen. Caution! Keep hands away from hot water! Do not soak menorah in water. To avoid damaging the menorah, do NOT try to remove wax by any other method. ITEM DIMENSIONS 10.75\" L x 2.00\" W x 2.50\" H WONDERFUL HANUKKAH GIFT IDEA - Rite Lite's stunning hand painted resin menorah is the perfect Judaica gift. This is sure to enhance your Chanukah experience. This ancient, symbolic Jewish ornament is known as the Hanukkah Menorah, which has eight branches. Celebrate the holiday with friends and family, or decorate your home with one of our large variety of Menorahs TRUST THE NUMBER 1 JUDAICA COMPANY FOR ALL YOUR CHANUKAH NEEDS: Rite Lite Ltd. is a leading manufacturer, importer and wholesaler of year-round, seasonal (Purim, Passover, Rosh Hashana, Chanukah, etc.) and occasion-based Jewish products (Judaica). Their extensive selection includes ceremonial items, gifts, decorations, serveware, educational toys and crafts, books and more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Z7TlZmKIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rite Lite","source_asin":"B000VNRGGW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062016","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VNRGGW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VNRGGW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1062017,"name":"LOKO Buffet Cabinet with Storage, Bar Cabinet with Five-Position Adjustable Shelf, Wine Cabinet Sideboard Console Table, 40 x 16 x 34 inches (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":179.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WiXSwmJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ample Storage Space】 Perplexed by the limited storage space in your kitchen or dining room? Well, LOKO buffet cabinet would be the cure for your headache by offering you with ample storage space, such as a flat countertop, a middle shelf and an enclosed storage space with adjustable shelf to have the scattered items well placed. 【Only for Dining Room?】 Of course not! It is not only an astonishing addition to your dining room for its practicality, but also great for kitchen or living room. Since the back of the sideboard is furnished and the whole unit is waterproof, you could place it in the middle of the your kitchen, making it a kitchen island in order to get extra space for food preparing. Or simply lean it against the wall, making it a coffee station. P2 MDF and particle board used to make this buffet cabinet solid. 【Flexibility】The shelf inside this bar cabinet is adjusted in five positions and the distance between each position is about 1.3 inches or you could leave it aside if you don’t want to use it. Such a flexible buffet table won’t make your disappointed. 【Assembly】The assembly of this wine cabinet won’t be too hard for you. You will get a detailed instruction and necessary hardware. If the instruction is not clear to you, you may contact us for the E version of the manual to have it set up and it’s better to assemble buffet cabinet with storage by two people. 【What LOKO Cares】LOKO pays great importance to customer’s satisfaction towards any of our products. For any reason, you are not satisfied with this kitchen buffet storage cabinet, just send us a message by indicating the detail problem and we would offer you with a feasible and simple solution to have the issue addressed in a fast way.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61WiXSwmJCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LOKO","source_asin":"B09HXNKN4R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09HXNKN4R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09HXNKN4R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
