window.products.push({"id":1062071,"name":"SC41 Oxygen Pillow Latex Bed Pillow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DzEqraQ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Deeper Sleep through Deeper BreathingEuropean Sleep Works designed the Oxygen Pillow specifically to aid airflow, creating the conditions for more restful, restorative sleep without sacrificing comfort.Constructed for SupportThe Oxygen Pillow has a unique tri-layer construction featuring a hollow core, internal hinges and added depth around the edges. During back sleeping, the hollow core allows the head to drop back into alignment while the edge supports the curve of the neck. For side sleeping, the internal hinges in the top and bottom layers flex to accommodate the shape of your head without collapsing at the edge. The pillow's edge \"fills in\" the span from neck to shoulder. Your head rotates back while your face turns slightly up - which helps keep your torso from rotating forward.Better Neck Support The Oxygen Pillow was engineered to do more than just support the neck. It was designed to impact breathing. But because of its unique construction, material stability, and sizing options, it has proven to provide exceptional neck support - better than standard \"contour\" pillows that claim to support your neck. The Oxygen pillow takes into account the anatomy of the neck and head. The hollow core design provides comfortable support from the top of the head through the chin providing side sleepers with the appropriate support. The design of contour pillows caters to back sleepers while often leaving the neck inadequately supported during side sleeping. Healthy breathing is the single most important factor during sleep. It affects the quality of your sleep and directly impacts your overall health.Maintains proper spinal and neck support.Opens the airway for expanded lung capacity during sleep for easier breathing.Works for both back and side sleeping.Can be used in any direction.Oeko-Tex certified latex foam and fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DzEqraQ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SC41","source_asin":"B07QNHJ5G3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QNHJ5G3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QNHJ5G3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1062072,"name":"iDesign Axis Metal Over the Door Quad Hook Hanger for Coats, Jackets, Hats, Robes, Towels, Ideal for Bathroom, Bedroom, Mudroom, Satin Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.01,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51h9kbKFRAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"iDesign's Axis Over the Door Quad Hook has a classic style that is great for hall entries, bathrooms, bedrooms, and mudrooms. Made of durable steel with a satin finish, it easily hangs over standard interior door and does not require any mounting hardware for your ultimate convenience. Simply hang the rack over your door and it's ready for use! Perfect to hang towels, jackets, purses, scarves and more to keep the clutter off the floor. Measuring at 5.5\" x 4.75\" x 7.25\", the iDesign Over the Door Quad Hook will bring you the organization of your dreams. With iDesign by InterDesign, you can #LiveSimply every day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51h9kbKFRAL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iDesign","source_asin":"B07XZVX5YZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07XZVX5YZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07XZVX5YZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
