window.products.push({"id":1062089,"name":"GoGreen Sprouter,Coffee Distributor and Tamper,Dual Head Espresso Leveler Fits for Portafilter Basket,Both Sides Adjustable Depth- Professional Espres","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sY122fSnS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"A Cup of Pure Coffee Begins with a Dual Head Espresso Coffee Leveler.Are you tired of coffee flavor imbalance caused by uneven coffee powder?Now, you only need to use this dual head coffee leveler to finish a few simple rotations, you can eliminate the key variables of making espresso, achieve uniform extrusionProduct weight:490gHOW IT WORKS:1 - Load your portafilter basket with the desired amount of freshly ground coffee.2 - Retract the distributor side to it's shallowest depth, and place the distributor on your portafilter, blade side down.3 - Gently spin the distributor until your coffee grounds have been evenly distributed and leveled. If the distributor does not reach the coffee, adjust the depth accordingly. Note: you do not want to be applying heavy pressure to the grounds at this stage -- only enough to level the coffee in the basket.4 - Flip the distributor over and extend the tamper (flat side) to its maximum height. Tamp your grounds to your desired pressure.5 - For consistent tamping every time, adjust the tamper depth so it matches the depth of the tamp you created in Step 4. How to adjust Coffee Distributor height?1.Rotate the two black adjusting rings in the middle counter clockwise to loosen them2.Fix the black adjusting ring by hand, and loosen the tamper (flat side) counterclockwise to the height you need (the adjustable height is 0-6mm) [3] Turn it over until the distributor side (blade side) is facing up3.Fix the black adjusting ring by hand, and turn the distributor surface (blade side) counterclockwise to the height you need (adjustable height is 0-6mm)4.Rotate the two black adjusting rings in the middle clockwise until they cannot be loosened5.Complete height adjustment, and no need to change after one adjustment","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71sY122fSnS._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GoGreen Sprouter","source_asin":"B091Y49BWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062089","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B091Y49BWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B091Y49BWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
