window.products.push({"id":1062147,"name":"Space Art Deco, 5.5x8.5 Business License Frame, Professionals Certificate Frame, Tempered Glass Wall Hangers or Easel Stand Display (Ornate Gold/Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZRP3SM9EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These frames were inspired by the design from classic and traditional works. While not as lavish and extravagant as the frames from the past eras, it still has its own charm and is definitely an eye catcher. This frame is designed to hold one 5.5 x 8.5 inch documents such as certificates, diplomas, and awards, as well as, photos and pictures. Celebrate graduation or receiving a distinguished award by showcasing it in this beautiful frame. Two colors that are made to compliment, not distract, from your accomplishments.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZRP3SM9EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Space Art Deco","source_asin":"B09SMWZWSM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SMWZWSM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SMWZWSM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1062148,"name":"Nachtmann Skin Tumbler/Double Old Fashioned Glass, Amethyst","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.12,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41T0ZY1W13L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Gorgeous and elegant, with a contemporary flair, this Nachtmann Skin crystal DOF tumbler features the purest amethyst color and the finest detailing in patterned cuts, reminiscent of beams reflecting from a spotlight, that reach in vertical lines from the base to the top. Create a matching set with its Skin amethyst highball glasses, or mix and match all colors in the Skin collection to create a vibrant barware set. Nachtmann, brought to you by the Riedel Family, is a new name in crystal to many consumers in the US, yet well-know across the globe. The Nachtmann Company has been producing fine crystal for over 170 years, using traditional glass blowing methods, as well as state-of-the-art technology. Nachtmann's 1,650-strong workforce is devoted to the artistic and craftsmanship-focused processing of fine-grade material lead crystal. The production emphasizes maximum quality, the purest raw materials, and pioneered technology, resulting in flawless, eye-catching glass creations. Amazon.com In a rainbow of jewel tones, Nachtmann's Skin barware collection combines traditional craftsmanship and modern artistry. Each Skin hue showcases a unique, light-infused design cut into 24 percent lead crystal--perfect for decorating in a favorite color or creating a custom set. The Amethyst tumbler/double old fashioned features intermingling clear and purple stripes stretching from base to rim. Holding 6-1/2 ounces, this elegant glass stands 3-5/8 inches tall and pairs with Amethyst highball/longdrink tumbler. Since 1834, Nachtmann artisans have taken part in the Bavarian tradition of fine glass making. Formerly renowned for it's signature collections commissioned by fine brands, this distinctive crystal is now offered to home collectors with the same high-quality materials and commitment to excellence. Every piece is individually made and hand-inspected in small factories in Bavaria. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41T0ZY1W13L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nachtmann","source_asin":"B000ALWA1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000ALWA1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000ALWA1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1062149,"name":"Elite Gourmet ECT4829B Long Slot 4 Slice Toaster, 6 Toast Settings Toaster Defrost, Reheat, Cancel Functions, Slide Out Crumb Tray, Extra Wide Slots f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W4WuHNnNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elite Gourmet Long Slot 4 Slice Toaster is a beautiful addition to any kitchen. Enjoy a wide variety of your favorite breads with the large toasting slots which can accommodate longer, rectangular slices of bread such as sourdough or other artisanal loafs. It features 6 variable toast shade settings as well as Cancel, Defrost, and Reheat functions all encased in a sleek, cool-touch housing. The extra-long space saving design easily fits 4 slices of toast while not cluttering your countertop.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W4WuHNnNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elite Gourmet","source_asin":"B0C6FT2VHW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062149","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6FT2VHW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6FT2VHW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
