window.products.push({"id":1062190,"name":"mDesign Kitchen Sink Dish Drying Mat/Grid - Soft Plastic Sink Protector, Cushions Sinks, Dishes - Quick Draining Diamond Design - Includes 1 Sink Pouc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wETltRXFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"SOFT PROTECTION: Sink pouch and sink mats keep sinks clean and scratch free; Perfect for double sink basins in the kitchen, laundry or utility room; Made of heavy, flexible plastic, the mats stay in place at the bottom of the sink to protect sink surfaces from scratches; The sink pouch is also made of flexible heavy and durable plastic to keep it secure on the sink divider; Pack of 3 CUSTOMIZED FIT: The plastic mat grips the sink and stays in place, no more sliding and slipping; The sink grid keeps dishes lifted off of sink surfaces so scratches and marring are a thing of the past; Cut out sections of the design for the sink drain or perfectly fit your sink size; The pouch straddles most standard sized double-sink dividers and keeps your cleaning essentials at your fingertips; Use in homes, apartments, condos, college dorms, RVs, campers and cabins IMPROVED DRAINAGE: The decorative organic design allows water to flow through so sinks don't become waterlogged or backed up; Water drains quickly and easily for faster air drying; The pouch stores sponges, scrubbers, soap bars and more in its two roomy side pockets and allows dish washing accessories to drip-dry directly into the sink and avoid wet messes on the countertop QUALITY CONSTRUCTION: Made of pliable water-safe PVC plastic; Do not place in dishwasher; For best results rinse thoroughly after every use THOUGHTFULLY SIZED: Each Sink Mat Measures: 12\" x 16\"; Sink Pouch Measures: 4.75\" x 4\" x 4.75\" high; Pouch fits over sink dividers up to 2\" / 5.08 cm thick","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wETltRXFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"mDesign","source_asin":"B07RH4H4C4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062190","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RH4H4C4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RH4H4C4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1062191,"name":"Decoccino Natural Rattan Farmhouse Round Wall Mirror 28\" Boho Circle Wicker Mirror for Wall, Rustic Handwoven Hanging Mirror Wall Decor for Bathroom, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jPjQD6NYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality Handmade Rattan Mirror: The round mirror is made of genuine 4mm back silver glass and 5-layer float technology, HD glass (high definition), CRI≧80Ra, explosion-proof and anti-scattering, corrosion-resistant, beautiful and natural, no distortion, easy to clean. Each rattan wall mirror is handcrafted by our expert artisans who have mastered the weaving and shaping of rattan and glass for years, rattan mirrors are extremely durable and sustainable. Bohemian Decorative Round Mirror: hand-woven into the shape of a flower around the round mirror with natural rattan, which is a kind of thin and flexible stem of a palm tree, which is lighter and more beautiful than traditional metal mirrors, and helps to protect the round mirror, more durable. Rattan mirrors can decorate almost anywhere, creating a natural farmhouse style for your home, and can also be combined with other decor styles such as Scandinavian, vintage, minimalist or neoclassical. Natural Color Home Art: Boho Round Rattan Wall Mirror measures 28 inches with a glass diameter of 13.38 inches. Whether it's a living room, bedroom, bathroom, foyer, office, entryway, hallway, over bed, dresser or over a fireplace it fits perfectly, creating a truly unique, functional and decorative piece for your home. This eco-friendly rattan mirror adds a natural texture and boho vibe—whether it's hung or not. Wall Mounted Rattan Mirror: The rattan round mirror comes pre-installed with a strong, durable hook on the back, so hanging this decorative woven wall mirror is a breeze. Just put the included expansion screws in place on the wall before hanging the mirror. (Package includes screws and hanging instructions) Sturdy Double-layer Foam Packaging: The wall mirror is professionally packaged and fixed in a carton with custom-made double-layer foam. It has passed strict tests such as drop and impact before leaving the factory to ensure a perfect mirror for you. Professional Service Team: If you have any problems after receiving the mirror, please do not hesitate to contact us, we will provide full compensation or replace the quality upon arrival, including breakage, deformation and defects. Your satisfaction is our constant pursuit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81jPjQD6NYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Decoccino","source_asin":"B0B4DD7314","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062191","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4DD7314","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4DD7314","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
