window.products.push({"id":1062234,"name":"Electric Meat Grinder, Telcuisine 2L Stainless Steel Food Processors Food Chopper for Meat, Onion, Vegetables & Fruits, 300W Meat Blender with 4 Sharp","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dl1zQ2kQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔【MULTI-FUNCTIONAL MEAT GRINDER】Our food processor is equipped with 4 stainless steel blades and 2 modes to choose, which is can easily grind and mix kinds of meats, vegetables and ingredients in short time, like beef, onions, garlic, potatoes, cheese, nuts, fruits, ect. Efficient and practical, this electric food chopper is an ideal gift for your mother, wife. ✔【2 SPEED MODES】The grinder for meat has 2 speeds control, fully meet your chopping needs for different ingredients, switch freely. Speed \"1\" is low speed, fits for soft food, such as onion, garlic, parsley, hot pepper, ect; Speed \"2\" is fast speed, fits for hard food, like meat, nuts, carrot, ice and more. This is a wonderful kitchen helper! ✔【HIGH-CAPACITY】Our electric chopper with a 2L capacity stainless steel bowl is durable to use for a long time. Unlike glass bowls, this stainless steel bowl is stronger, healthier and shock-proof, ensuring durability. ✔【EASY TO CLEAN】All the parts of the beef grinder including lid, blades, stainless steel bowl are detachable and can be cleaned in dishwasher (except the motor). Just rinse it with water and simply wipe the base of the food processors with a damp cloth. Detachable design make it easy to move and store. ✔【POWERFUL & EFFICIENT】The electric meat grinder is made of high quality stainless steel, which is durable and not easily broken. With the 300W powerful motor and 4 sharp blades, our electric meat blender can chop and mixing a variety of ingredients quickly, which is more efficient and fast. The mini chopper has an overheat protection function that automatically stops working under high temperature and cools down sufficiently.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dl1zQ2kQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Telcuisine","source_asin":"B0BZNG89RF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062234","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZNG89RF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZNG89RF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
