window.products.push({"id":1062250,"name":"Table & Bloom Macrame Fruit Hammock - Premium Cotton Macrame Basket with Natural Mango Wood - Includes Mounting Hardware - For Kitchen Under Cabinet H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71He73jgk3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Table & Bloom focuses on providing innovative and affordable home & lifestyle accessories which are meant to make your life easier, without compromising on style or practicality. We make it a rule from working only with premium grade materials and reliable manufacturers, in order to live up to your rigorous expectations. Our products perfectly combine functionality with design, helping create a warm, nurturing living space for the entire family. Should you not be entirely pleased with your purchase, our customer care department is at your disposal and will address any issues or concerns!  Elegant Space Saving Solution for Your Fruit and Vegetable Storage Needs  The Table & Bloom fruit hammock is definitely a must in any modern kitchen, being a practical and smart way of preserving your fruits and vegetables fresh for longer, at the same time encouraging healthy snacking! Made with superb cotton macrame and mango wood dowels, with heavy duty mounting hardware and easy DIY installation system, this fruit holder adds a romantic, boho touch to your kitchen décor, blending in well with any style!  Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product:  Dimensions: 18.5” long x 11.8”wide; Copper finish straps and plated steel hardware; Multiple mounting options; Plenty of room for your fruits and veggies, space saving design; Double woven hammock size for increased durability; Original gift idea for friends, family.  You’ll fall in love instantly with this beautifully crafted macrame basket for kitchen countertop!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71He73jgk3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Table & Bloom","source_asin":"B09G61HKFJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062250","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G61HKFJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G61HKFJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
