window.products.push({"id":1062487,"name":"NIBESSER Armless Chair Slipcover Waterproof Accent Chair Cover, Stretchable Elastic Fabric Removable, Chair Covers Furniture Protector Covers for Hote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xu71qMskL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super Stretch Material : Armless chair covers are made of 85% Polyester and 15% Spandex. feature two-way high stretchy and luxurious, feel smooth, durable. Suitable Armless Chair Size : Chair Back Height 13-17\",Chair Back Length 21.5-25.5\",Seat Length: 18.25-22.25\".Seat Width: 21-25\".Seat Height:8.75-12.75''.Due to manual measurement, there may actually be some errors.Please comfirm the accent chair size befor you buy,thanks for your understanding. Surrport Protector: This chair cover can not only make your chair look new, but also can effectively prevent dust and splash (not 100% water proof), providing intimate care for your chair. Elegant Outlook Design: We choose jacquard designs, which are elegant and beautiful. It‘s suitable for the diversified decoration style of home, also can be used for hotels, and other occasions. Wash Warm Tips: Easy to clean and wash, machine washable, but do not bleach and iron. If you have any questions while using, please feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61xu71qMskL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIBESSER","source_asin":"B08L4QJPJH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L4QJPJH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L4QJPJH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1062488,"name":"Skytech AFVK-SP-MH/L-Split Manual High/Low Split Spark to Pilot Gas Valve Kit with On/Off/High/Low Remote","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":581.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iWz6fVA8L._SL1499_.jpg","description":"The Skytech AFVK-SP-MH/L SPLIT electronic safety pilot system was developed to provide safe, reliable, user-friendly control for gas heating appliances. These intermittent pilot ignition (IPI) gas valve kits are set up for natural gas (NG) only and are designed to be used with 18 to 30-inch gas log sets. Optional propane (LP) gas conversions kits LPK-18 or LPK-24 are available. The AFVK-SP-MH/L SPLIT features a manual Hi/Lo spark to pilot gas valve and a flame modulating remote control with On/Off/Hi/Lo infinite flame adjustment and On/Off continuous pilot. This gas log safety pilot is divided into two sections, the gas valve box and the switch box. Both boxes are pre-assembled and ready to install. With each box on separate sides of the gas log burner pan it enables the log set to be centered inside the fireplace. The valve box contains gas valve and pilot assembly and the switch box contains an electronic module and battery back. Both boxes are joined together with a hi-tempered wiring harness. Includes valve box, switch box (battery pack, module and switch), installation instructions, RS-1A heat shield, transmitter, damper clamp, AA batteries, 12v battery, and flex connecter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iWz6fVA8L._SL1499_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SkyTech","source_asin":"B07782V23R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062488","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07782V23R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07782V23R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
