window.products.push({"id":1062598,"name":"Rockcloud Pack of 4 1.3\" Thumb Worry Stone Oval Shape Pocket Palm Stone Chakra Balancing for Anxiety Stress Relief Meditation, Fluorite","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M-c4ryHSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Pack of 4 Pocket Stone: Each package contains 4 crystal stones. The size of the stone is 1.34~1.57 inches (34~40mm) in length, 0.94~1.18 inches (24~30mm) in width, and 0.2~0.35 inches (5~9mm) in thickness. The weight of each stone ranges from 7g to 18g. Small in size, it's perfect in your pocket, and carry it with you as your amulet to protect you all day long. Thumb Worry Stone: Worry stone, also known as thumb stone or palm stone, has a thumb-shaped concave in the middle, fits well to your fingers to press. It helps to generate positive energy and relieve your anxiety. When you feel tired or stressed, you can just press it anytime and anywhere to help you relax. Hand-polished Worry Stone: Hand polished into an oval shape, the surface of the stone is very smooth and has a good sense of touch. You can hold it while thinking or meditating to help stabilize your emotion, relieve stress, and concentrate. You can also use it as an ornament to decorate your desk. Powerful Palm Stone: Fluorite is a stone of the sacral chakra, which can help people purify their bodies and relieve the influence of negative emotions. Besides, it helps to enhance thinking ability, stimulates the right brain function, and can be used for meditation and inspiration. Ideal Gift Choice: Comes with an exquisite velvet gift bag, always ready for gift giving. Meditating with this worry stone is good for relaxing or relieving anxiety, which is very suitable for brain-workers or the people who fancy the crystal stones. The energy contained in it also helps balance the chakras and makes people full of positive energy. It is very well as a birthday or holiday gift to your family, friends, or colleagues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61M-c4ryHSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rockcloud","source_asin":"B09CFHQNGN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CFHQNGN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CFHQNGN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
