window.products.push({"id":1062639,"name":"100LEDs Fairy USB LED Wire String Lights - USB Powered Starry Starry Lights (Warm White) for Festival, Christmas, Holiday, Wedding and Party (Waterpro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715WV7tZWlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"What can you do with fairy string light?  Wrap it around your birth tree, crepe myrtle or patio beams to create a dreamy backyard.  Hang it with a curtain behind a bed to make a fairy-tale like headboard.  Put up these diamond lights on silver wire over head at your wedding.  Make rope light word wall art.  You name it! The wire is very thin and easy to wrap on just about anything! TORCHSTAR always aims at providing you with more easy-to-use products, this USB wire light is just one of them.  Designed with a USB plug, this light can be powered by USB devices (compatible with almost any 5V 500mA/1A/2A USB devices). You can use it with a power bank, desktop computer or TV with a USB port. The 33ft flexible wire is made of copper covered with silver plate, thus is water-proof, flexible yet tenacious.  When you are tired of your DIY project, you can take it down anytime and reshape it into another creative installation. With over 20 years’ service time,  it can save you a huge fortune compared with constantly buying new decorations. One string contains 100 pieces of water-drop shaped SMD LEDs and each led consumes 0.06Watt. It’s energy saving as the whole 33ft string only consumes 6Watt.  The light (not the PLUG) can be submerged in the water, providing omnidirectional illumination. Fairy LED string light comes in three color options, WARM WHITE, DAYLIGHT and RGBY in our store. Warm white (2200K) is yellow and cozy; daylight is bright and clear; RGBY presents four colors. Specification Material: copper wire with silver plated  Color temperature: warm white 2200K  Shell size: wire length 10000mm/33ft  Power plug: USB port  LED: 100 pcs SMD 0603 LEDs  Wattage: 0.06/led 6/total Package includes： 1 pc warm white LED wire light with USB plug","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715WV7tZWlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TORCHSTAR","source_asin":"B00JTNNQFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062639","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JTNNQFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JTNNQFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
