window.products.push({"id":1062805,"name":"NC Marshmallow Roasting Sticks with Interchangeable Attachments | 4 Sets Campfire BBQ Kit | Great for Marshmallow and Hot Dogs and Biscuit Cup | Smore","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bc8y+RRxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing is more nostalgic about summer nights than singing songs, telling ghost stories, and toasting marshmallows around a campfire! Want to kick back with a few friends, some ice-cold brews, and enjoy weiners roasted over a fire pit in your backyard Even if you just have a grill, you can still enjoy cooking on a stick if you have the right product! Sure you could grab branches off the ground, but a Revolution Campfire BBQ Cookware the telescopic roasting stick with interchangeable attachments gives you incredible versatility to cook a variety of quick and delicious comfort foods over an open fire. It's so compact transportation and storage are a cinch. And the high-grade stainless steel attachments are dishwasher safe making cleanup easier than ever. We designed the Marshmallow roasting sticks are much different with other, The telescopic roasting stick with interchangeable attachments,our roasting stick as the number one set that will fit the needs of most households. They have balanced features that make them versatile, and they got good reviews for durability. Telescopic Handle: The handles are made of wood, normally beech for its durability and sturdy, you can feel solid in your hand and they don't get hot. The telescoping handle allows you to adjust the length based on the distance from the fire. the sticks are easily stored in the drawstring bag or zippered bag. Rotating Forks: The forks are made of 304 Stainless Steel , the Stainless Steel Easy to Clean, the fork gives you two tines, so you can easily and efficiently heat up hot dogs or sausages, vegetables, etc. Wooden Tube: You wrap biscuit dough around it and toast it. The result is a little biscuit cup you can fill with anything you like, whether it's sweet or savory! A recipe book is even included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Bc8y+RRxS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B0982NGX5Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062805","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0982NGX5Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0982NGX5Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
