window.products.push({"id":1062823,"name":"TKK Glass Travel Mug with Spill Proof Lid & Carry Handle, 14 OZ Reusable Leak Proof Iced Coffee Cup, Anti-slip Silicone Sleeve - BPA Free, Pink","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510Mk3lyorL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SAFETY AND DURABLE: Our coffee mug is made of durable borosilicate glass, The silicone sleeve and PP lid are Food-grade and BPA-free. It’s free from toxins and chemicals, will not taint the flavor of your coffee. It is totally food-safe and long-lasting. And the glass bottle is also 100% safe and lead-free for keeping food fresh in a healthy way. FLIP TOP LID GLASS CUP: Press-type open lid design - Press by the finger on the lid, then it will pop up easily. If you push under the button to lock the bottle mouth, then it can prevent accidentally touching the switch. The top lid with handle can make you carry the cup easily, and the handle can be hidden on the lid. The top lid with strainer can help you filter out tea bags, coffee bags, lemon slices, etc. WIDE MOUTH GLASS TRAVEL CUPS WITH SLEEVE: This glass travel cups come with wide mouth that enough to fit ice cubes, also easy to clean. Colorful silicone sleeves prove a no-slip grip. Anti-slip silicone sleeve design also protects your hand from temperature burning. LEAKPROOF & PORTABLE: Our iced coffee cup is good for you to take anywhere. Drinking jar lid with a seal ring makes it 100% leak-proof. Portable to carry around in bag or car cup holder. Good choice for home, office, bars, restaurants, travel, camping. Perfect gift for bachelorette parties, Birthday, Valentine's day, Mother's day, Father's day, Thanksgiving day, Christmas day or any occasion. MULTIFUNCTIONAL TUMBLERS: TKK coffee travel mug is designed for enjoying your favorite beverages on-the-go. Whether you drink smoothies, iced tea, juices, or water, everything tastes better in glassware. Dishwasher-safe. The reusable 14 oz glass jars drinking tumbler mug can be your go-to everyday mug for travel, on-the-go.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510Mk3lyorL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TKK","source_asin":"B0BTSZCV4H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062823","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTSZCV4H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTSZCV4H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1062824,"name":"Silk Pillowcase King,Mulberry Silk Pillow Case,Health,Soft and Smooth,Anti Acne,Beauty Sleep,Both Sides Natural Silk Satin Pillow Covers with Hidden Z","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71umXp2IgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕【Fights Dryness and Acne】Silk pillowcases are made of high-quality silk fabric, rich in 18 amino acids, which are believed to effectively stimulate the metabolism of skin cells.So your skin will maintain the balanced moisture needed to form a protective layer.The more moisture your skin is hydrated，the less visible fine lines and wrinkles are. 💕【Protect Hair and Face】We spend third of our lives in bed - life can be refined if we turn our sleep into silky spa. Our mulberry silk pillowcase has pearly sheen that provides smooth finish to your face and hair, allowing your hair to glide through, reducing friction by 45% and reducing facial wrinkles. It also protects your hair from tangles and gives it natural and healthy glow. Silk also has an inherent cooling ability, giving silk pillow case luxurious touch. 💕【Thermoregulator】Available all year round, naturalsilk regulates the heat, keeping you cool in hot summer and warm in winter. Natural silk pillowcase perfect for sleeping moments. 💕【Perfect Craftsmanship】Our DBKSLIK silk pillowcases are made with care for you, the sewing needle is 4 stitches / 1cm long, the stitches are neat and fine, strong and durable, hidden zipper closure design makes silk pillowcase perfect to hold your pillow overnight. No need to go around Moving around, the large opening and long zipper make it easier to place your pillow. 💕【Ideal Gift】 Choose from a wide variety of colors and sizes, buy our products, and come packaged in a fancy envelope gift box. Silk is symbol of love and nobility and elegance, so silk pillowcases are ideal gift choices for birthdays, anniversaries, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving, New Year's Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71umXp2IgFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DKBslik","source_asin":"B0BBQTMKJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBQTMKJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBQTMKJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
