window.products.push({"id":1062856,"name":"100% Pure Linen Duvet Cover Queen: 90","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81htJHNtBhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We are happy to supply you with 100% pure flax linen bedding imported from Europe. Over many years, the word “linen” has come to represent bedding made from all fabrics. This is misleading because linen, as it was originally defined, is a natural fabric made from the flax plant. In order to avoid confusion, we refer to our flax-derived linen bedding as 100% pure linen – which is superior in its fine quality and offers several health benefits. Today, the world is once again undergoing a linen boom. The gravitation of current fashion trends towards all that’s natural doesn’t fully account for this resurgence in popularity – cotton, for one, is also a natural product that does not offer nearly as many health benefits. Our pure linen bedding, made exclusively for us by the finest textile mill in Belarus, and imported into the USA by Sofia’s Linen!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81htJHNtBhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sofia's Linen","source_asin":"B0097TYF74","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0097TYF74","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0097TYF74","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
