window.products.push({"id":1062947,"name":"Timber Tool Box, Big Sky Carvers Bearfoots Bear Grand Series","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZciidQjQL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"For more than 20 years, DEMDACO has designed and sold giftable products intended to “Lift the Spirit”—in times of celebration, when comfort is needed, or just to put a smile on someone’s face. The hand-curated artisan gifts it develops and distributes are chosen for their potential to help people nurture goodness in the lives of others, celebrate family and friends, and encourage people to treat themselves. We partner with artists representing a wide range of styles and mediums, and whose work is consistent with our values. Products are curated through this filter, then carefully reproduced by skilled craftspeople around the world. Under the DEMDACO brand, product categories include Gifts, Home Décor, Entertaining, Fashion, Baby, Holiday, and Outdoors. DEMDACO also maintains a partnership with artist Susan Lordi, offering her popular Willow Tree sculptures. Timber Toolbox is a functional, rustic-design box with whimsical bear and tree accents offer inspiration for outdoor-themed décor in a lake house or other home space. Toolbox is made of hand cast resin stone. These beloved black bears take on human traits and behaviors with humor, poignancy, and a lot of heart and soul. Toolbox measures approximately 13 x 10 inches. The rugged simplicity of this toolbox design makes it great for toting. Keepsake quality piece is the perfect gift for housewarming, wedding, or bridal shower. By Jeff Fleming. Ships in protective packaging.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ZciidQjQL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grands Series","source_asin":"B078ZZ7466","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062947","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078ZZ7466","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078ZZ7466","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
