window.products.push({"id":1062964,"name":"Ancient Cookware® Bracero de Mesa, Argentinean Table Meat Warmer, Enameled","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wD9Q9TCKL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"Since the time that the Gauchos started herding in the Argentinean Pampas, cooking meat over a fire has been a tradition in Argentina. Today, an Argentinean asado, or barbecue is a cultural ritual consisting of various kinds of sausages, sweetbread, various succulent cuts of beef, and sometimes chicken, and accompanied by chimichurri sauce. Ours is made of high quality durable cast steel, double coated with extra heavy glaze enamel and then kiln dried to a brilliant black with white speckles. Care and Use Be careful when using hot coals! It is not recommended to use indoors as the burning ambers (especially charcoal) can be dangerous. When using the Brasero with hot ambers, make sure you are in a well ventilated area; do not use coals in enclosed areas. If outdoors, avoid placing the Brasero where the wind can spread the ashes to flammable materials. Do not put a hot Brasero directly on top of or around any highly-inflammable surfaces. For your safety, use protective mitts when handling the brasero. Thoroughly wash and dry the Brasero before first use. After using, allow the Brasero to cool before washing as rapid swings in temperature may crack enamel. For everyday cleaning, hand washing in hot, soapy water and drying it thoroughly with a soft cloth before storing is recommended to maintain the best appearance of the Brasero. Since the exterior glaze enamel is kiln dried at 1,600° Fahrenheit, the surface is rather resilient and can even be scrubbed with a scrubber of steel wool to remove dried-on or burnt food. Another excellent cleaner for keeping the interior and exterior of the enamel shiny is Soft Scrub Cleanser. It is not necessary and not recommended to soak in water for an extended time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wD9Q9TCKL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ancient Cookware","source_asin":"B00KQS9XI6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KQS9XI6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KQS9XI6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1062965,"name":"Standing Comfort Anti Fatigue Mat: Foam Ergonomic Standing Floor Mat - Non Slip Cushioned Kitchen Mat - Anti-Fatigue Standing Desk Pad - Durable & Sta","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s5YWB4oRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"PICK A MAT  Standing for long periods of time on your home’s hard floors causes mounting pain and pressure in your feet, legs and lower back. Take Ten Comfort’s anti-fatigue mats alleviate your discomfort by providing you with a soft, supportive surface to stand on. These cloud-like mats are ideal for kitchens, stand-up desks, laundry rooms, bathroom vanities, and craft rooms. Choose from a wide variety of attractive colors to suit your style. Mats are offered in 20-inch by 32-inch and 20-inch by 48-inch sizes.   SUPPORTIVE CUSHIONING  engineered with 0.75-inch foam, our mats conform to your feet to encourage proper circulation in your lower extremities. With less joint stiffness and muscle cramping, you will feel more rested and at your best each and every day.   NON SLIP BOTTOM  Unlike other floor mats that slip and slide around and wear out, ours can be counted on to remain securely in place and retain their firmness despite high foot traffic. A non-slip bottom prevents slippage whether you step on them with your bare feet, slippers or shoes. Navigate your home with complete confidence!   BEVELED EDGES  Cushioned mats are wonderful for hardwood, stone and linoleum floors, but they can be easy to trip over when your attention is focused elsewhere. We made our mats with no-curl beveled edges to stop you from catching the edge with your foot and dropping your dinner or injuring yourself.   EASY TO CLEAN  Keeping your comfort mat clean is a breeze! Each mat has a stain resistant top surface that can be wiped clean or dusted with a broom. There is also no toxic off-gassing smell to wrinkle your nose at. With regular cleaning, our mats will continue to look like new!   - Take Ten Comfort Anti-Fatigue Mat  - Foam Mat with Beveled Edges and Slip-Resistant Bottom  - Available in a Variety of Colors  - Available Sizes: 20 x 32 or 20 x 48 in.  - Made in USA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s5YWB4oRL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Take Ten Comfort","source_asin":"B07DWJCFVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1062965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DWJCFVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DWJCFVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
